cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, cite it; if you use the numbers, cite the dataset and the two papers below."
title: "FLYWATT: a fruit fly connectome, wired to a light bulb"
type: software
url: "https://flywatt.live"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-13
abstract: "A leaky integrate-and-fire simulation of 38,178 neurons and 5,124,215 synapses of the Janelia FlyEM Male CNS connectome v1.0 (visual input to wing motor pathway), running in a Web Worker, driving an incandescent bulb. Power is spike rate times a literature estimate of the energy of one action potential."
